{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9f2b6f1a-2b3a-4c1d-9e3a-aali-market-api",
    "name": "Aali Market API",
    "description": "Price-first mobile shopping API for small-town India. All money is integer paise. Bilingual fields are { en, hi }. Every response is { success, data, error }.\n\nFlow to try this collection end to end:\n1. Auth > Send OTP, check the server console for the printed code (SMS_PROVIDER=console in dev), then Auth > Verify OTP (auto-saves accessToken/refreshToken).\n2. Catalog > List Categories / List Products (auto-saves categoryId/productId/productSlug).\n3. Cart > Add Item, Apply Coupon (code AALI50, needs subtotal >= ₹199).\n4. Addresses > Create Address (auto-saves addressId).\n5. Orders > Create Order (auto-saves orderId) — Idempotency-Key header uses the {{$guid}} dynamic variable, so re-sending the exact same request body+key replays the same order.\n6. Admin folder uses its own adminAccessToken — Send/Verify OTP with the seeded admin mobile (9999999999 by default).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "serverRoot", "value": "http://localhost:4000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "{{serverRoot}}/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "mobile", "value": "9876543210", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "otpCode", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminMobile", "value": "9999999999", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminOtpCode", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminAccessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminRefreshToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "categoryId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "productSlug", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "couponCode", "value": "AALI50", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "addressId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "bannerId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "createdProductId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "createdCategoryId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "createdCouponId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "createdBannerId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Send OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"mobile\":\"{{mobile}}\",\"purpose\":\"login\"}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/send", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "otp", "send"] },
            "description": "Rate-limited to 3 sends / 15 min / mobile. In dev (SMS_PROVIDER=console) the code is printed to the server console, not sent via SMS."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify OTP",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 200 or 201', function () { pm.expect([200, 201]).to.include(pm.response.code); });",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.data.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.data.refreshToken);",
                  "  console.log('Saved accessToken for user', json.data.user && json.data.user.mobile);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"mobile\":\"{{mobile}}\",\"code\":\"{{otpCode}}\",\"purpose\":\"login\",\"name\":\"Ritesh\"}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/verify", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "otp", "verify"] },
            "description": "Set collection variable {{otpCode}} to the value printed in the server console before sending. Creates the user on first verify. Auto-saves accessToken/refreshToken."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.data.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.data.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"refreshToken\":\"{{refreshToken}}\"}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "refresh"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"refreshToken\":\"{{refreshToken}}\"}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"name\":\"Ritesh Kumar\",\"email\":\"ritesh@example.com\"}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["me"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Catalog",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Categories",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.length) { pm.collectionVariables.set('categoryId', json.data[0].id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["categories"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Banners",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/banners", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["banners"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Products",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.length) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('productId', json.data[0].id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('productSlug', json.data[0].slug);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('has pagination meta', function () { pm.expect(json.meta).to.have.property('total'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&limit=20&sort=newest",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "sort", "value": "newest" },
                { "key": "category", "value": "{{categoryId}}", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "minPrice", "value": "0", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "maxPrice", "value": "100000", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "brand", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "rating", "value": "4", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "inStock", "value": "true", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "q", "value": "atta", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "sort: popular | price_asc | price_desc | newest | discount"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Product by Slug",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productSlug}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["products", "{{productSlug}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Related Products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/related?limit=10",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products", "{{productId}}", "related"],
              "query": [{ "key": "limit", "value": "10" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Product Reviews",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/reviews?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products", "{{productId}}", "reviews"],
              "query": [{ "key": "page", "value": "1" }, { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Product Review",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"rating\":5,\"comment\":\"Great quality and fast delivery.\"}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/reviews", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["products", "{{productId}}", "reviews"] },
            "description": "Requires the user to have a DELIVERED order containing this product — otherwise returns REVIEW_REQUIRES_DELIVERED_ORDER."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cart",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Cart",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["cart"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Item",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"productId\":\"{{productId}}\",\"qty\":2}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart/items", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["cart", "items"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Item Qty",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"qty\":3}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart/items/{{productId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["cart", "items", "{{productId}}"] },
            "description": "qty: 0 removes the item"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove Item",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart/items/{{productId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["cart", "items", "{{productId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Apply Coupon",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"code\":\"{{couponCode}}\"}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart/coupon", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["cart", "coupon"] },
            "description": "AALI50 needs a subtotal of at least ₹199 (19900 paise). Errors: COUPON_NOT_FOUND, COUPON_INACTIVE, COUPON_EXPIRED, COUPON_NOT_STARTED, COUPON_MIN_ORDER, COUPON_USAGE_LIMIT_REACHED, COUPON_PER_USER_LIMIT_REACHED, CART_EMPTY."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove Coupon",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart/coupon", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["cart", "coupon"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Clear Cart",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["cart"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Addresses",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Addresses",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/addresses", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["addresses"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Address",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('addressId', json.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"label\":\"Home\",\"line1\":\"123 MG Road\",\"line2\":\"Near Bus Stand\",\"landmark\":\"Opposite Petrol Pump\",\"city\":\"Sitapur\",\"state\":\"Uttar Pradesh\",\"pincode\":\"261001\",\"isDefault\":true}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/addresses", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["addresses"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Address",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"landmark\":\"Near City Hospital\"}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/addresses/{{addressId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["addresses", "{{addressId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Set Default Address",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/addresses/{{addressId}}/default", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["addresses", "{{addressId}}", "default"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Address",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/addresses/{{addressId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["addresses", "{{addressId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Check Serviceability",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/serviceability?pincode=261001",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["serviceability"],
              "query": [{ "key": "pincode", "value": "261001" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Orders",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Order",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', json.data.id);",
                  "  console.log('Order created:', json.data.orderNumber);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}", "description": "Re-sending the same key + body replays the original order instead of creating a duplicate." }
            ],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"addressId\":\"{{addressId}}\",\"paymentMethod\":\"cod\"}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["orders"] },
            "description": "paymentMethod: cod | upi | card | netbanking. Re-validates stock/price/coupon and decrements stock inside a transaction."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Orders",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["orders"],
              "query": [{ "key": "page", "value": "1" }, { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Order",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["orders", "{{orderId}}"] },
            "description": "Includes statusHistory for the tracking screen."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancel Order",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"reason\":\"Changed my mind\"}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["orders", "{{orderId}}", "cancel"] },
            "description": "Only while status is placed/confirmed/packed — otherwise ORDER_NOT_CANCELLABLE."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Payments",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Webhook (mock payment captured)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-webhook-signature", "value": "dev-signature", "description": "mock provider accepts any non-empty signature; razorpay provider verifies HMAC-SHA256 against RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"orderId\":\"order_mock_replace_with_paymentProviderOrderId\",\"status\":\"captured\"}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payments/webhook", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["payments", "webhook"] },
            "description": "Set orderId to the paymentProviderOrderId returned on an order placed with a non-COD paymentMethod. Body is read as raw bytes server-side for signature verification, then parsed as JSON."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Wishlist",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Wishlist",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wishlist", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["wishlist"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add to Wishlist",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wishlist/{{productId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["wishlist", "{{productId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove from Wishlist",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wishlist/{{productId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["wishlist", "{{productId}}"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Admin - Send OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"mobile\":\"{{adminMobile}}\",\"purpose\":\"login\"}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/send", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "otp", "send"] },
            "description": "adminMobile defaults to 9999999999 (SEED_ADMIN_MOBILE) — must already exist via `npm run seed`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin - Verify OTP",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if ([200, 201].includes(pm.response.code)) {",
                  "  var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('adminAccessToken', json.data.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('adminRefreshToken', json.data.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
